OL,5,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe week's final visit is to The
OL,7,     FCrown Inn in Derbyshire, where a
OL,8,     Ftrip to an old mill proves to be
OL,9,     Finexplicably popular. More so than
OL,10,     FDean's supposedly legendary
OL,11,     Fbreakfast, anyway...
OL,12,G1930 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FPeace. Tranquillity. Relaxation.
OL,14,     FUnfortunately, it's payment day,
OL,15,     Fso there's none of that here.
OL,16,     FInstead, there are slanderous
OL,17,     Fsleep scores, bad breakfasts, and
OL,18,     Fa no-show from two B&Bers!
